{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11204220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204220","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1120422001:0":{"text":"信埋进土里的瞬间，我感到了放松很多，像是完成了告别……","source_cn":"信埋进土里的瞬间，我感到了放松很多，像是完成了告别……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA0BF92E9F86E29A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120422002:0":{"text":"我想起来了，贾克松大哥之前为什么会说很羡慕我。","source_cn":"我想起来了，贾克松大哥之前为什么会说很羡慕我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47A11724B67E6FB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120422003:0":{"text":"为什么？","source_cn":"为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18E7417DCB53E6D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120422004:0":{"text":"当时我们蜷缩在岩壁后面躲避沙暴，他问我，我们是不是要死了。","source_cn":"当时我们蜷缩在岩壁后面躲避沙暴，他问我，我们是不是要死了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66EFCEE4D920070A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120422005:0":{"text":"我说：不！要是我死了，梅丽莎一定会哭出来的！","source_cn":"我说：不！要是我死了，梅丽莎一定会哭出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95F65CE4EBFC18FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"s